                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.11/491: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-03-26T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 26,
                                1927—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>102. Your 254, March 25, 9 [<hi rendition="#italic">4</hi>] p.m. Authorization
                    requested in paragraph 4 granted. Do you see any objection to making this public
                    here?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
